Here is the generated code to evaluate:

<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<p id="demoNarration" style="margin:0;font-size:10px;max-width:210px;line-height:1.4">The teal dashed line is the horizontal at flight altitude; each gray sight line opens downward from it, giving the 25° depression angle to B and the 49° depression angle to A from a single shared vertex.</p>
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px">
  <button onclick="prevStep()">◀</button>
  <span id="stepLabel" style="font-size:10px">Step 1 / 3</span>
